      "comment": "PICCADILLY PETE NZ (9) produced a good performance last time out when third at Menangle. Has had two months off since but was kept ticking over with a trial and there is no harm in drawing here with the sprint lane to rely upon. Looks nicely placed. WEONA MISS MIKI (4) has been out of the money since winning at Menangle last month but will relish the return to a circuit and distance where she has won five of six attempts. MICHAYWEY (7) has the hoof on the till after seconds in his last two outings, going under by narrow margins each time. Chance to go one better. MISSAUDACIOUS (8) added to a string of good efforts when fourth from this barrier last week. Go well again.",
